instrument wingie
; sound system: what the mics hear, tuned, voiced and rebuilt for a big stack.
; Play the bottom keys to set the key. fader1 (Mix), fader2 (Decay), fader3 (Volume) as noted.

the dub plate
-------------
; the room through a comb tuned to the bottom keys, its low end split off and doubled an
; octave down by a pure sine that follows the bass; fader1 is the sub, fader2 the drive
the teeth are specfilter shape=harmonics
the stack is bassman 2
mic.both -> teeth
the oct1 is transpose
octave1 -> oct1
keys1.pitch -> oct1.pitch
oct1 -> teeth.pitch
the depth is value 90
depth -> teeth.shape_amount
teeth -> stack
fader1 -> stack.sub
fader2 -> stack.drive
stack -> out
stack.sub -> lights.left
teeth -> lights.right

the choir in the traffic
------------------------
; the mics sung in three just voices (4:5:6:7 over what you hear), the bottom keys move the
; whole chord, fader1 is how much of the choir
the choir is harmonizer samplerate=half chord=otonal detune=6
the oct1 is transpose
octave1 -> oct1
keys1.pitch -> oct1.pitch
mic.both -> choir
oct1 -> choir.pitch
fader1 -> choir.mix
choir.left -> left
choir.right -> right
choir.left -> lights.left
choir.right -> lights.right

the highway sings the chord
---------------------------
; a just chord takes the spectrum of the traffic: its partials, the hiss's colours.
; fader1 blends, fader2 smooths it into a vocoder, fader3 is the hall it sounds in
the drone is chord 2
the cross is morph samplerate=half
the hall is reverblite 3
the oct1 is transpose
octave1 -> oct1
keys1.pitch -> oct1.pitch
oct1 -> drone.pitch
mic.both -> cross.a
drone -> cross.b
fader1 -> cross.blend
fader2 -> cross.smooth
cross -> hall
fader3 -> hall.size
cross hall -> out
mic.both -> lights.left
cross -> lights.right
